. Setting: 地下室.","imageGenMeta":{"rawImgDesc":"精致的半构装体吹出一个巨大的蓝色风铃草色泡泡糖气泡","subjectOverride":null,"location":"地下室","sceneType":"chat"},"roundId":"group_round_1784011892378_8tb3dgv","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783192851479","_id":2390},{"id":1784020869405,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"614aaf9d-b215-4095-bed4-cad72525e524","senderName":"艾萨克","text":"气压稳定，表面张力已达到当前最大值。亲爱的，它折射出的光线频率非常好看。","timestamp":"2026-07-14T06:52:02.832Z","roundId":"group_round_1784011892378_8tb3dgv","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783192851479","_id":2391},{"id":1784020869406,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ac21e9ce-3339-4e8d-b262-d5283ee4be78","senderName":"维林·纳夏斯","text":"残缺的蛛腿在力场球底座上不安地交叠，暗红色的眼眸扫过屏幕上的论坛截图，喉咙里发出一声极轻的、带着嘲弄的嘶嘶声","timestamp":"2026-07-14T06:52:05.671Z","type":"state","roundId":"group_round_1784011892378_8tb3dgv","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783192851479","_id":2392},{"id":1784020869407,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ac21e9ce-3339-4e8d-b262-d5283ee4be78","senderName":"维林·纳夏斯","text":"回主人的话……这在魔索布莱城再正常不过了。蜘蛛神后最喜欢看的就是背叛与杀戮。","timestamp":"2026-07-14T06:52:08.527Z","roundId":"group_round_1784011892378_8tb3dgv","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783192851479","_id":2393},{"id":1784020869408,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ac21e9ce-3339-4e8d-b262-d5283ee4be78","senderName":"维林·纳夏斯","text":"那些不入流的小家族，每隔一段时间就会被主母们当成讨好罗丝的祭品。纳邦德尔时柱附近的东区……大概又是哪个女祭司为了抢夺一点点可悲的权力，动用了蛇头鞭和蜘蛛教院的刺客。","timestamp":"2026-07-14T06:52:10.133Z","roundId":"group_round_1784011892378_8tb3dgv","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783192851479","_id":2394},{"id":1784020869409,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ac21e9ce-3339-4e8d-b262-d5283ee4be78","senderName":"维林·纳夏斯","text":"用仅剩的半截前肢费力地抱紧了带有主人气味的旧衣服，仰起头，眼神病态而庆幸","timestamp":"2026-07-14T06:52:12.952Z","type":"state","roundId":"group_round_1784011892378_8tb3dgv","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783192851479","_